<section id="cftIntro" class="section-content section-margin article-text">
    <article class="gap-v gap-h">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>After meeting with the rock cover band, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/cardsfortoday/">Cards for
                Today</a>, I educated myself about the origin behind their name. Medical students use a program called
            <a href="https://www.ama-assn.org/medical-students/usmle-step-1-2/what-anki">Anki Cards</a> for studying
            purposes, and a phrase they often use when speaking with each other is, "What's in the cards for today?"
            Therefore, the star in Anki Cards branding in conjunction with the classic 4 suit card deck inspired me in
            my design process.
        </p>
    </article>
</section>